  "content": "[Verse 1]\n[E]All my life,\n[F#m/E]without a doubt I give you\n[A]All my life,\n[Am]now and forever till the\n[Amaj7]Day I die,\n[G#m7]you and I will share\n[F#m7]\n[E]All the things\n[F#m/E]this changing world can offer\n[A]And so I sing,\n[Am]I'd be happy just to\n[Amaj7]Stay this way,\n[G#m7]spend each day, with you\n[F#m7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[A]There was a time,\n[B/A]that I just thought That I would lose\n[G#m7]my mind\n[C#7]You came along and then the sun\n[F#m7]did shine\n[Badd11]We started on our way\n[E]\n[Am7]I do recall\n[B/A]that every moment spent Was\n[G#m7]wasted time\n[C#7]but then I chose to lay it on\n[F#m7]the line\n[B7sus4]I put the past away\n[D]I put the past away\n[A]I put the past away\n\n[Guitar Solo]\n[E]\n[Bm]\n[A]\n[Am]\n[G#m7]\n[C#m7]\n[F#m7]\n[Badd11]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E]All my life,\n[F#m/E]I will carry you through\n[A]All my life,\n[Am]between each hour of the\n[Amaj7]passing days\n[G#m7]I will stay with you\n[F#m7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[A]But there was a time,\n[B/A]that I just thought That I would lose\n[G#m7]my mind\n[C#7]You came along and then the sun\n[F#m7]did shine\n[Badd11]We started out our way\n[E]\n[A]I do recall\n[B/A]that every moment spent Was\n[G#m7]wasted time\n[C#7]but then I chose to lay it on\n[F#m7]the line\n\n[Outro]\n[Badd11]I want this all my life\n[D]I want this all my life\n[A]I want this all my life\n[E]I want this all my life\n[D]I want this all my life\n[A]I wanted this all my\n[E]life",
